  unitName: Silva Khopesh Serge
  unitId: 30847
  unitNumber: 1460
  description: He attempted to extract vengeance against the dragon demon clan alongside
    Viktor's daughter, but the stories hold that he was quite reluctant to target
    the child of the dragon demon clan's leader. One theory holds that this conflict
    dulled his edge and even led to his defeat at the hands of an Elder Summoner
    in Grand Gaia. Had his days in Ishgria changed him more deeply and left him callous
    in all matters, the outcome of the battle likely would have been very different.
  summonDesc: Ishgria...is hell.<br>But that's why it makes people stronger. I grew
    stronger. How about you?
  fusionDesc: Who do you want me to kill?<br>Since you're giving me power, that must
    mean you want something for it, right?
  evoDesc: I've already let go of emotion...<br>If I hadn't, there's no way I could've
    survived in Ishgria!
  element: 3
  rarity: 7
